WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Desk Setup Switcher · Bring your desk back, deliberately.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
1. Capture — Read available Display and Sound values. Nothing changes.

00:10.000 --> 00:18.000
2. Edit Display — Choose the main display and an available resolution.

00:18.000 --> 00:26.000
3. Edit Sound — Choose output and input devices, volumes, and output mute.

00:26.000 --> 00:36.000
4. Review — Check every planned change before the separate Apply confirmation.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.000
Local only. No account, telemetry, cloud sync, or automatic profile switching.
